+Speculative Production Additions - Summary
+----------------------------------------
+This patch provides:
+ - A production-ready teacher scoring service (services/speculative/teacher/teacher_score_prod.py).
+ - A tokenizer parity checker service (services/speculative/tokenizer_parity_checker.py).
+ - Prometheus alert rules for speculative mode (monitoring/prometheus/alerts_speculative_more.yml).
+ - Circuit breaker controller to auto-disable/enable speculative mode based on metrics (services/speculative/circuit_breaker/controller.py).
+ - A small React token trace component (services/evidence/ui/TokenTrace.jsx) for forensic UIs.
+ - GitHub Actions workflow to run a simple canary toggle based on Prometheus and circuit-breaker API.
+ - Pytest unit tests for tokenizer parity checks (tests/speculative/test_tokenizer_parity.py).
+
+Operator Actions:
+ 1. Build and push teacher scoring image (Dockerfile not included here; use Python base with torch & transformers).
+ 2. Deploy teacher scoring service on GPU nodes and set TEACHER_MODEL, TEACHER_DEVICE env vars.
+ 3. Deploy tokenizer parity checker in staging and run sample checks against student endpoints.
+ 4. Apply Prometheus alert rules and configure alerting channels.
+ 5. Deploy circuit breaker controller and configure PROMETHEUS_URL, CB_CONFIGMAP if using cluster-wide toggle.
+ 6. Integrate TokenTrace component into your rater/forensics UI to show token-level decisions.
+ 7. Run pytest tests as part of CI to validate tokenizer parity for candidate models.
+
+Notes:
+ - Replace sequential scoring with batched/padded scoring for performance at scale.
+ - Protect endpoints with mTLS/OIDC and restrict access to inference cluster network.
+ - Tune thresholds in alerts and circuit breaker according to shadow data before enabling automation.
+
